-- v3.2.0: bug-fix release (hitbox path, Firebase $-keys, EnumItem round-trip, grep line
-- numbers, ColorSequence colors, chat-history restore) + hardening and dead-code removal.

if plugin == nil then
 warn("[Golem] This script must run as a Roblox Studio plugin.")
 return
end

